           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Luminal-Apocrine-Metaplastic-Basal (LAMB) classifier for bulk
    breast cancer expression data. Assigns research samples to six
    expression-defined classes reflecting a proposed mammary differentiation
    hierarchy: LHS, Apocrine, MA-Lo (HER2), Basal-like, Chondroid, and
    Squamous. External evaluation covers bulk cohorts only; single-cell and
    spatial pseudobulk are supported mechanically but not externally
    validated. Classification uses a deterministic
    decision tree powered by singscore rank enrichment. The package is for
    research use and its labels are not clinical diagnoses.
